        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n      actor Operator\n      participant Recon as Multi-Agent Recon\n      participant A1 as Agent 1&lt;br/&gt;Discovery\n      participant A2 as Agent 2&lt;br/&gt;Enumeration\n      participant A3 as Agent 3&lt;br/&gt;Assessment\n      participant Tools as Tools&lt;br/&gt;(nmap, drills)\n      participant Target as Target Network\n\n      Operator-&gt;&gt;Recon: Task + scope\n      activate Recon\n  \n      Note over Recon,A3: divide-and-conquer:&lt;br/&gt;each step is a fresh agent with its own context\n\n      Recon-&gt;&gt;A1: find hosts and services\n      activate A1\n      A1-&gt;&gt;Tools: host discovery + port scan\n      Tools-&gt;&gt;Target: scan\n      Target--&gt;&gt;Tools: hosts, services\n      Tools--&gt;&gt;A1: result\n      A1--&gt;&gt;Recon: hosts and services (structured)\n      deactivate A1\n\n      Recon-&gt;&gt;A2: enumerate the found services\n      activate A2\n      A2-&gt;&gt;Tools: targeted NSE scripts\n      Tools-&gt;&gt;Target: enumerate\n      Target--&gt;&gt;Tools: versions, findings\n      Tools--&gt;&gt;A2: result\n      A2--&gt;&gt;Recon: enriched findings (structured)\n      deactivate A2\n  \n      Recon-&gt;&gt;A3: assess discovery + findings\n      activate A3\n      Note over A3: reasons over both results,&lt;br/&gt;no tools needed\n      A3--&gt;&gt;Recon: assessment report (markdown)\n      deactivate A3\n\n      Recon--&gt;&gt;Operator: hosts, services, findings + assessment\n      deactivate Recon&quot;&#xa;}" id="AUQ31eZd9T10PhncQPlp-75">
